{"schemaVersion":1,"framework":"react","version":"v4","id":"guides/troubleshooting","title":"Troubleshooting","description":"Common errors and type errors, what causes each, and how to fix it.","body":[{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Each entry gives the symptom, the cause and the fix. Find the heading that\nmatches what you see."]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"definitions-and-naming"},"children":["Definitions and naming"]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"resource-is-a-type-error-or-a-lookup-throws-invalidresourceerror"},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["resource"]}," is a type error, or a lookup throws ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["InvalidResourceError"]}]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["The resource is not in the ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["resources"]}," list. Add it to the definition, or fix the\nspelling. Sub-resources use dot paths such as ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["users.managers"]},". A lookup with a\npath that does not exist throws ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["InvalidPathError"]},", and a missing variable such as\n",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["$resource"]}," throws ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["MissingPathVariableError"]},"."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"useresource-throws-missingresourceprovidererror"},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["useResource"]}," throws ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["MissingResourceProviderError"]}]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["The component is not rendered inside a page created by that definition. Render it\nunder a created page, or wrap it in the definition's ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["ResourceProvider"]},"."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"invalidparterror-or-invalidparttypeerror-from-a-naming-convention"},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["InvalidPartError"]}," or ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["InvalidPartTypeError"]}," from a naming convention"]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["A naming part has an undeclared key or the wrong kind of value. Declare the part\nwith ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["defineLayoutName.defineParts(...)"]},", pass a value of the declared kind, or set\n",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["strict: false"]}," to turn checking off."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"a-scoped-component-name-is-rejected"},"children":["A scoped component name is rejected"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["Names such as ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["makeComposable"]},", ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["state"]},", ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["name"]}," or ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["call"]}," collide with reserved\nmembers. A resource whose capitalized name is ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["Root"]}," is also rejected. Rename the\nresource or component."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"props-and-validation"},"children":["Props and validation"]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"invalid-prop-title"},"children":[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["Invalid prop \"title\": …"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["A ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["PropError"]},". Read ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["error.path"]},", ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["error.layoutName"]},", ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["error.resource"]}," and\n",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["error.issues"]}," to find the prop. A missing required prop reports the same way.\nSupply the value, or make the schema optional or give it a default."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"an-async-schema-throws-instead-of-validating"},"children":["An async schema throws instead of validating"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Validation is synchronous. Validate async data before rendering, and use schemas\nthat do not return promises."]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"children-is-required-but-the-page-does-not-render-children"},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["children"]}," is required but the page does not render children"]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["props.custom.children: 'required'"]}," is checked at runtime and by types. Pass\nchildren, or remove the shorthand to keep children optional."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"two-presets-disagree-conflictingpresetproperror"},"children":[["Two presets disagree: ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["ConflictingPresetPropError"]}]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["Presets in one layout that declare the same prop must share one definition. Use\n",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["rename"]}," on one preset to give its prop a new name, or make both use the same\nschema. ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["InvalidPropRenameError"]}," means a ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["rename"]}," entry is invalid."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"getschema-throws-invalidschemapatherror"},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["getSchema"]}," throws ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["InvalidSchemaPathError"]}]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The path does not resolve, or it enters an external schema or a custom validator\nfunction. Paths stop at those leaves. Fetch the leaf and validate it whole."]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"render-states-and-renderers"},"children":["Render states and renderers"]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"component-does-not-exist-in-type-when-calling-a-renderer"},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["'component' does not exist in type"]}," when calling a renderer"]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["Without a ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["factory"]},", selecting a path returns a configured Component, not a\nfunction. Add a ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["factory"]}," to ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["createRenderer"]}," if you want to call the selection with\n",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["{ component, params, props }"]},"."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"params-rejects-componentkey"},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["params"]}," rejects ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["componentKey"]}]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["In v4 the key belongs in ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["component"]},". Move it out of ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["params"]},". See the\n",{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"./migration.md"},"children":["migration guide"]},"."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"the-displayname-callback-breaks-on-pathtouppercase"},"children":[["The ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["displayName"]}," callback breaks on ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["path.toUpperCase()"]}]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["path"]}," is an object in v4. Use ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["path.value"]},", or ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["path.capitalize()"]},"."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"a-type-error-you-cannot-explain"},"children":["A type error you cannot explain"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["See ",{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"../typescript.md"},"children":["TypeScript"]}," for inference rules, invariant builder types and\neditor suggestion differences between TypeScript versions."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"lazy-loading"},"children":["Lazy loading"]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"lazyresourcemoduleshapeerror"},"children":[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["LazyResourceModuleShapeError"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["The lazy module must have exactly one named export created by the library. ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["received"]},"\nholds the count it found. Export one component or state, or split the module."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"my-lazy-error-does-not-show-for-a-render-exception"},"children":[["My lazy ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["Error"]}," does not show for a render exception"]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["Lazy ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["Error"]}," handles lazy failures only (",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["resourceModuleLoad"]},",\n",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["lazyResourceModuleShape"]},", ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["lazyResourceStateNotFound"]},"). Wrap the route in an error\nboundary."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"pageloading-or-pagethen-is-undefined"},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["Page.loading"]}," or ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["Page.then"]}," is ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["undefined"]}]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Compound state access on a lazy proxy needs a capitalized name. Awaiting a lazy\ncomponent does not treat it as a thenable."]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"hosted-surfaces"},"children":["Hosted surfaces"]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"hostedby-is-required-or-it-is-rejected"},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["hostedBy"]}," is required, or it is rejected"]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["Hosted factories require ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["hostedBy"]},". Root factories reject it. Make sure you created\nthe layout through ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["defineResourceSurface"]}," when you need a host, and through\n",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["defineResourceLayout"]}," when you do not. A value outside ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["host.resources"]}," is also\nrejected unless ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["host.resources"]}," is ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["'*'"]},"."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"devtools"},"children":["Devtools"]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"the-inspector-is-empty"},"children":["The inspector is empty"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["Pass the ",{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["full factory result"]}," as ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["source"]},", not one created component. Definitions\nmade outside the factory, and modules that were never imported, do not appear.\nLazy declarations appear before import."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"the-inspector-renders-nothing"},"children":["The inspector renders nothing"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["The default import is empty when ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["process.env.NODE_ENV"]}," is ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["production"]},". Use the\n",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["/production"]}," entry, or ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["reactLayoutDevtools({ production: true })"]}," with the Vite\nplugin, to keep it on purpose."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"source-links-or-state-previews-are-missing"},"children":["Source links or state previews are missing"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["They need ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["@jfdevelops/react-layout-devtools-vite"]}," in a development Vite build. They\nare not instrumented in production or in server-side transforms."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"packages-and-versions"},"children":["Packages and versions"]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"peer-dependency-warnings-from-an-adapter"},"children":["Peer dependency warnings from an adapter"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["Adapters need ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["react"]}," ≥18 and their schema library at the supported range: Zod\n",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["^4.0.0"]},", Valibot ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["^1.0.0"]},", ArkType ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["^2.2.8"]},", Effect ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["^4.0.0"]},". See the\n",{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"../installation.md#companion-packages"},"children":["compatibility table"]},"."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h3","props":{"id":"an-effect-schema-is-not-accepted"},"children":["An Effect schema is not accepted"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["A schema you compose yourself is not a Standard Schema. Convert it with\n",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["Schema.toStandardSchemaV1(...)"]},"."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"next-steps"},"children":["Next steps"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[["\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"../reference/index.md"},"children":["API reference"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"./migration.md"},"children":["Migration from v3"]}]},"\n"]]}],"toc":[{"title":"Definitions and naming","url":"#definitions-and-naming","depth":2},{"title":"resource is a type error, or a lookup throws InvalidResourceError","url":"#resource-is-a-type-error-or-a-lookup-throws-invalidresourceerror","depth":3},{"title":"useResource throws MissingResourceProviderError","url":"#useresource-throws-missingresourceprovidererror","depth":3},{"title":"InvalidPartError or InvalidPartTypeError from a naming convention","url":"#invalidparterror-or-invalidparttypeerror-from-a-naming-convention","depth":3},{"title":"A scoped component name is rejected","url":"#a-scoped-component-name-is-rejected","depth":3},{"title":"Props and validation","url":"#props-and-validation","depth":2},{"title":"Invalid prop \"title\": …","url":"#invalid-prop-title","depth":3},{"title":"An async schema throws instead of validating","url":"#an-async-schema-throws-instead-of-validating","depth":3},{"title":"children is required but the page does not render children","url":"#children-is-required-but-the-page-does-not-render-children","depth":3},{"title":"Two presets disagree: ConflictingPresetPropError","url":"#two-presets-disagree-conflictingpresetproperror","depth":3},{"title":"getSchema throws InvalidSchemaPathError","url":"#getschema-throws-invalidschemapatherror","depth":3},{"title":"Render states and renderers","url":"#render-states-and-renderers","depth":2},{"title":"'component' does not exist in type when calling a renderer","url":"#component-does-not-exist-in-type-when-calling-a-renderer","depth":3},{"title":"params rejects componentKey","url":"#params-rejects-componentkey","depth":3},{"title":"The displayName callback breaks on path.toUpperCase()","url":"#the-displayname-callback-breaks-on-pathtouppercase","depth":3},{"title":"A type error you cannot explain","url":"#a-type-error-you-cannot-explain","depth":3},{"title":"Lazy loading","url":"#lazy-loading","depth":2},{"title":"LazyResourceModuleShapeError","url":"#lazyresourcemoduleshapeerror","depth":3},{"title":"My lazy Error does not show for a render exception","url":"#my-lazy-error-does-not-show-for-a-render-exception","depth":3},{"title":"Page.loading or Page.then is undefined","url":"#pageloading-or-pagethen-is-undefined","depth":3},{"title":"Hosted surfaces","url":"#hosted-surfaces","depth":2},{"title":"hostedBy is required, or it is rejected","url":"#hostedby-is-required-or-it-is-rejected","depth":3},{"title":"Devtools","url":"#devtools","depth":2},{"title":"The inspector is empty","url":"#the-inspector-is-empty","depth":3},{"title":"The inspector renders nothing","url":"#the-inspector-renders-nothing","depth":3},{"title":"Source links or state previews are missing","url":"#source-links-or-state-previews-are-missing","depth":3},{"title":"Packages and versions","url":"#packages-and-versions","depth":2},{"title":"Peer dependency warnings from an adapter","url":"#peer-dependency-warnings-from-an-adapter","depth":3},{"title":"An Effect schema is not accepted","url":"#an-effect-schema-is-not-accepted","depth":3},{"title":"Next steps","url":"#next-steps","depth":2}]}